# Environment variables
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# This site intentionally requires NO environment variables.
#
# Every brand, contact, domain, social, and SEO value lives in
#   site.config.ts   (project root)
#
# That file is the single source of truth. It is checked into git on
# purpose, so the site builds identically on every machine and every
# Vercel deployment without anyone having to configure secrets.
#
# Add a .env.local only if you later add a feature that needs one
# (a contact form handler, an email API key, analytics). Never put
# brand or SEO values here: they belong in site.config.ts so that
# there is exactly one place to look.
# ------------------------------------------------------------------
